sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant DB as Database

    App->>Cache: Get data
    alt Cache hit
        Cache->>App: Return cached data
    else Cache miss
        Cache->>App: Cache miss (nil)
        App->>DB: Query database
        DB->>App: Return data
        App->>Cache: Store data with TTL
        App->>App: Use data
    end